    "Scan of the 1970 edition of the Bluemont, Virginia, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1970; photo inspected in 1981; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1991.",
